+boards, `boards_reachable_count`, `hardware_wishlist_updated=true`, no host
+block-device touches, `inference_substrate=hardware_smoke`, and
+`no_speedup_claim=true`.
+
+**Implementation status:** Pending (Exp 5179)
+
